  "description": "Most people buy the dip. Most people fail. Do the opposite!",
  "body_html": "<p>This is a hill I will die on… “Buy the high!”</p><p>And its a video I make once every 1 to 3 months. Dip buyers and “dollar cost average” folk love to get sassy in the comments. If buying the dip was so successful, a habit that <em><strong>MOST</strong></em> retail investors do… then why do <em><strong>MOST</strong></em> retail investors fail? Stop doing what <em><strong>MOST</strong></em> do!</p><p>A stock that “feels” expensive, is likely signaling to you that there is demand for that stock, and that valuations will go higher. Trend is friend. Meanwhile, a stock that “feels” cheap, is signaling to you there is less demand, and it is likely valuations will go lower. Now always for these 2 situations, but <em><strong>MOST</strong></em> of the time. Dip buying works in bull markets, but after 19 years of investing, I have seen countless dip buyers destroy their portfolios with bull market corroborated bad habits.</p><p>Every single stock from Midweek Movers this year, went up, averaging 25.9%. 75% of them over the course of the year, are still up today. And nearly all of them were at highs!</p><p>Clearly something is working here. </p><p>If you would like to<strong> <a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-332318854?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">leave a ticker for me to review, leave it on this note (click here)</a>,</strong> as I will be reviewing the stocks tomorrow, and the episode will come out either tomorrow afternoon or Thursday morning. This is where I rank your favorite stocks from worst to first, and how we have found so many winning stocks. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>The first day of the market, it is usually quiet. I like to see how the markets digests the news from the weekend… as many of you know, the news has been particularly chaotic lately!</p><p>I posted yesterday <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-market-is-panicking-again-heres?r=4z8lgl\">Stocks I am looking to buy this week</a></strong>, and am actively monitoring for entry. </p><p>Feel free to swing by the<strong> <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/eb3f00e6-9f30-4570-8e48-c0bde66e4eec\">Main Chat</a> </strong>if you have any questions or just want to chat. We have several other great investors and traders in there.</p><p>Thanks for stopping by! </p><h4>Please remember to like ❤️ and re-stack 🔄 this post! </h4><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/buying-the-stocks-high-is-working?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Know someone into investing? Share this post with them!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/buying-the-stocks-high-is-working?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/buying-the-stocks-high-is-working?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div>",
